{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpi",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Files without DDR info",
                  "field": "finding_count",
                  "format": "number",
                  "tone": "warning",
                  "toneWhen": "nonzero"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Formulas affected",
                  "field": "affected_formulas",
                  "format": "number",
                  "tone": "warning",
                  "toneWhen": "nonzero"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Plug-in formulas affected",
                  "field": "affected_plugin_formulas",
                  "format": "number",
                  "tone": "warning",
                  "toneWhen": "nonzero"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Files in solution",
                  "field": "files_total",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "findings_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Files exported without DDR info"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "findings"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "findings_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": "auto",
              "searchAutoThreshold": 3,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search file…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "name",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "filemaker_version",
                  "label": "FileMaker"
                },
                {
                  "field": "saxml_profile",
                  "label": "SaXML",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "formulas_total",
                  "label": "Formulas",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "plugin_text_formulas",
                  "label": "Plug-in formulas",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "{{type}}",
                  "file": "{{file}}"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "Every file was exported with DDR info."
              },
              "alwaysShowCount": true
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "notes_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "About this check"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "notes_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "A FileMaker file saved as XML **without** the option *Include details for analysis tools* carries no `DDR_INFO` block. The import still succeeds and looks complete — scripts, fields, layouts and every formula text are present — but the DDR chunk stream is the **only** source of formula references: no field reads/writes from calculations, no function or custom-function calls, no plug-in calls for anything defined in that file. Where-used, the plug-in inventory and the object graph are silently blind for it.\n\n**No fix inside FM-Lab.** The information is absent from the export: save the file again with the option enabled and import it again. The formula counts show what is lost; *plug-in formulas* uses the same text vocabulary as the rule **Plug-in call without reference** (MBS plus every plug-in prefix the catalog knows) and is a lower bound.\n\nThe XML-import page shows the same verdict before the import (header probe of each file), the import log reports it as a warning."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
